info.screen.roleid.niaoshoushou:
Killer team
Passive [Super Stamina]: run 5s continuously for Speed I.
Passive [Niaoshoushou's Flame]: corpses of players you kill burn and vanish after 5s.
Shop:
 - Kukri (4 durability, attacks and pries doors);
 - Incendiary grenade (throwable, 45s cd);
 - Family Portrait (one per match, right-click two Killer players or a Magician to form a family! Each member gets 30%% of the other two's combined coins; after everyone dies, Niaoshoushou revives in a random room with Speed II and one incendiary);
 - Loitering missile (60s cd, steerable with arrow keys, explodes on hitting a player or ground);
 - Area lights out (30-block radius, 2 min cd).
Skill [Cover]: place a 3x2 wall for 20s; refills every 60s, max 2 stored.
